+    // An iteration budget is what makes one step fail at dt = 2e-4:
+    // the step ending at t = 5.4 ms needs 7 Newton iterations from the
+    // previous state and 6 or fewer after one halving (measured: 6 ->
+    // one retry with one halving, 5 -> six halvings, 7 -> no retry).
+    // Before the smooth diode was made passive (fix-nonlinear-diode-
